      <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated">
        <item>Which statements are true?
    <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated"><item>All three functions are linear functions.</item><item>All three functions have the same rate of change.</item><item>All three functions have a constant rate of change.</item></list>
 </item>
